{
  "$schema": "./node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "_": [
    "Root Stryker config for the `extensions/` contract surface, which is",
    "covered by `packages/app-tools/src/__tests__/extensions.test.ts`",
    "(vitest config at packages/app-tools/vitest.config.ts).",
    "",
    "Sibling configs cover the other workspace contract surfaces:",
    "  - stryker.mcp-worker.conf.json  → apps/mcp-worker/src/*.ts",
    "  - stryker.web-shared.conf.json  → apps/web/src/shared/*.ts",
    "",
    "scripts/mutation/run.sh auto-routes --related files across all three",
    "configs by path prefix. Full mode iterates every registered config.",
    "",
    "Deferred (non-goals): coachbyte/chefbyte MCP tool handlers under",
    "packages/app-tools/src/{coachbyte,chefbyte}/ only have integration",
    "tests that require a live Supabase — see scripts/mutation/README.md."
  ],

  "packageManager": "pnpm",
  "testRunner": "vitest",
  "plugins": ["@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner"],

  "vitest": {
    "configFile": "packages/app-tools/vitest.config.ts",
    "dir": "packages/app-tools"
  },

  "coverageAnalysis": "perTest",
  "timeoutMS": 10000,
  "timeoutFactor": 1.5,
  "concurrency": 2,

  "mutate": [
    "extensions/**/*.ts",
    "!extensions/**/*.test.ts",
    "!extensions/**/*.spec.ts",
    "!extensions/**/__tests__/**"
  ],

  "ignorePatterns": [
    "dist",
    "coverage",
    "legacy",
    "hardware",
    "supabase/migrations",
    "packages/db-types/src/database.ts",
    "**/*.tsbuildinfo",
    ".verify",
    ".turbo",
    ".wrangler",
    ".vercel",
    ".stryker-tmp"
  ],

  "reporters": ["progress", "clear-text", "json"],
  "jsonReporter": { "fileName": "reports/mutation/mutation.json" },

  "thresholds": {
    "high": 60,
    "low": 40,
    "break": 40
  },

  "tempDirName": ".stryker-tmp",
  "cleanTempDir": true
}
